{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char5181","label":"Drake: Great Villain"},"label":"The Peace That Ensues","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_04","next":null,"speakers":{"announcer":"Announcer","malejournalist":"Male Reporter","femalecitizen":"Female Citizen","maleexpert":"Male Professor","drake_p":"Drake","citizenry":"Citizens"},"icons":{"announcer":"si_c912_00_s","malejournalist":"si_c999_00_s","femalecitizen":"si_c999_00_s","maleexpert":"si_c999_00_s","drake_p":"si_c104_00_s","citizenry":"si_c999_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_1","text":"Up next is a story that put smiles on citizens' faces last weekend.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_cottoncandy","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_2","text":"Just recently, Drake of Matis personally hosted a charity fundraiser.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_3","text":"Many citizens of the Ark participated in this event and donated to help those in need.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_4","text":"While the large turnout posed a risk of accidents,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_5","text":"citizens expressed that an event with such good intentions deserved an attitude to match.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_6","text":"It was heartwarming to see citizens voluntarily maintaining order as they participated in the charity event.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_7","text":"But this remarkable display of community spirit did not end at the event venue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcer","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_8","text":"Let's hear more from our reporter on the scene.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_9","text":"The invitations were reportedly handed out by Matis's Drake herself on the streets of the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_10","text":"With only around a hundred copies said to have been distributed,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_11","text":"some of them have been listed at a premium on online marketplaces.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"femalecitizen","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_12","text":"I'd still want one, even at that price. There are so few of them in existence, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"femalecitizen","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_13","text":"Even so, the event was for a good cause, and I didn't want to spoil that by buying one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_14","text":"Thanks to the citizens' remarkable community spirit, donations collected from the event and beyond have reportedly reached a record high.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_15","text":"Experts have pointed out that this fundraising event was not only driven by good intentions, but also by a masterfully executed strategy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleexpert","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_16","text":"While she certainly leveraged her own popularity, I believe her collaboration with the Commander of Counters also played a significant role.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleexpert","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_17","text":"After all, the level of attention generated when two highly influential figures come together is something that can't be overlooked.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleexpert","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_18","text":"Moreover, the fact that the Commander closely followed Drake's lead makes it difficult to believe there was no prior coordination.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleexpert","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_19","text":"It may have seemed like a spontaneous collaboration, but it was likely carefully planned behind the scenes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleexpert","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_20","text":"... Drake is more than just a kind-hearted hero. She may very well be the most meticulous and strategic hero we've ever seen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_21","text":"In addition to the partnership between two of the Ark's most well-known figures,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_22","text":"many believe Drake's long-standing reputation as a hero played a major role in the fundraiser's success.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_23","text":"The event proved why Drake, now equipped with upgraded gear, has earned the title of Great Hero.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"malejournalist","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_24","text":"Now, all eyes are on how far Drake's acts of kindness will go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_25","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["drake_p"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_26","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_drake_greatvillain_05_26","text":"*Beep*","jum